  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"334\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"123\">About Our Brand and Products:</strong><br data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"126\">Harmony Holistics is a natural health and wellness brand dedicated to helping people live in balance—physically and mentally We offer a carefully curated range of holistic products including:</p><ul data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"572\"><li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"401\"><p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"401\">100% natural shea butter and tallow cream for skin nourishment</p></li><li data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"498\"><p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"498\">Powerful adaptogenic supplements like cordyceps, lion’s mane, maca root, and mushroom blends</p></li><li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"572\"><p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"572\">A self-created holistic health eBook with practical tips for wellness</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"670\">Our focus is on simple, natural solutions that support vitality, longevity, and inner harmony.</p><hr data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\"><p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"705\">What Makes Us Different:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1075\"><li data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"788\"><p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"788\">Products that are clean, natural, and rooted in holistic wellness traditions</p></li><li data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"862\"><p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"862\">A brand voice that’s authentic, heart-centered, and community-focused</p></li><li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"986\"><p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"986\">An engaged social media presence with over 190k+ followers across platforms, already generating strong organic interest</p></li><li data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1075\"><p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1075\">Educational value (through our eBook and resources) in addition to physical products</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1080\"><p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1112\"><strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1110\">How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1342\"><li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1165\"><p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1165\">30% commission rates on every referred sale</p></li><li data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1228\"><p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1228\">Opportunities for recurring earnings with repeat customers</p></li><li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1296\"><p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1296\">Regular promotions and discounts to help boost your conversions</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\"><p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1423\"><strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1371\">How to Promote Us:</strong><br data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1374\">Affiliates can share Harmony Holistics through:</p><ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1770\"><li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1481\"><p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1481\">Blogs, wellness websites, and product review articles</p></li><li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1586\"><p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1586\">Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook pages focused on natural health, fitness, mindfulness, and self-care</p></li><li data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1675\"><p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1675\">YouTube content (product reviews, wellness routines, “day in the life” videos, etc.)</p></li><li data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1732\"><p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1732\">Email newsletters for health and lifestyle audiences</p></li><li data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1770\"><p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1770\">Affiliate coupon or deal websites</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1858\"><strong>We’ll also provide creatives, product images, and guidance to make promotion easier.</strong></p></div></div>",
